41","doc":"Support of the raw normal form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9.mk","kind":"ctor","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9","kind":"structure","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean#L35-L47","doc":"The data of the two quotient ideals `I₈` and `I₉` for a normal form whose\nsupport is `support`.  `absorbedI8`/`absorbedI9` flag the reduced words\nremoved by each ideal; `structCoeff` records the structural coefficient\n(transfer-matrix off-diagonal entry) assigned to an absorbed word. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:gs-quotient-ideals-I8-I9","label":"def:gs-quotient-ideals-I8-I9","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.ReducedWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.ReducedWord","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean#L32-L33","doc":"A reduced word, encoded as the list of its generator indices. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OptimalNF.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OptimalNF.R_q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean#L29-L30","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}